vesktop (1.6.9-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * debian/rules: set chrome-sandbox 4755 after dh_fixperms. The chmod in
    dh_auto_install (or no chmod at all) left the setuid sandbox helper at
    0755 because dh_fixperms strips setuid from every file.

